d run R-731, dated 2028-04-03: final_status=SUCCEEDED; output_rows=240. The receipt does not record attempt_count, retry_count, per-attempt timestamps, HTTP status codes, exception classes, or the configuration revision used by the run. A successful final status alone does not distinguish first-attempt success from success after a retry.","score":0.1547298176,"start":0,"title":"KiteLoad R-731 retained completion receipt","source":"synthetic:kiteload/r-731-receipt","chunk_id":"chunk:d56f249a4779a12f0f26e506","bm25_score":0.1547298176,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"kl-run","content_sha256":"f32c2010b30cc18d3ca2ab0d81c8ad7d13983a5423aa70afb9642b827afe867b"},{"end":259,"rank":3,"text":"Archived alert card transcription for R-731: 'Badge: 3; delivery complete'. The export contains no badge legend and no per-attempt events. It does not say that the badge is an attempt or retry count. No upstream response code or rate-limit event was included.","score":0.1169571105,"start":0,"title":"KiteLoad R-731 archived alert card transcription","source":"synthetic:kiteload/r-731-card","chunk_id":"chunk:444a7ad72bf5110501fe71bc","bm25_score":0.1169571105,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"kl-alert","content_sha256":"0545261a1f029da919d87b55527ba166d8d67453cf4bb0b7c3887b856d0e6811"},{"end":675,"rank":4,"text":"Historical evidence inventory for R-731, compiled 2028-05-22. The only retained run-specific artifacts supplied here are the completion receipt and alert-card transcription. The worker attempt ledger was not exported before its 24-hour retention expired. No run-time configuration snapshot, upstream request trace, or per-attempt failure record is available in this evidence bundle. Establishing that a retry happened requires an authoritative retry counter or linked per-attempt execution records. Attributing an attempt failure to upstream rate limiting requires a corresponding upstream response or correlated failure record; retry settings alone cannot establish a cause.","score":0.